    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1435">

                <pb facs="1102" n="986" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg986"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/123.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Davis to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guadalajara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 24, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>General, Northern Division, called meeting foreigners for the purpose of exacting
                    contributions support of the army. I objected as to Americans, withdrawing from
                    meeting.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
